  "details": "When you go to logout, VRchat remains open and the only way to close it is to end task or ALT-F4.\n\nPlease put a simple exit/X button on the main screen so people can logout first, then exit the game (my preference in any online game).\n\nALT-F4 should be a last resort, as it ends the application messily and causes it to hang while you are closing it.",
